b.com/users/yliu120","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"@yliu120 Thank you for your quick reply. I set up v5p-16 (2 workers) and it detected \"8 devices\" as intended. \r\n\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2024-01-25T15:15:16Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/19493#issuecomment-1910412319","id":1910412319,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19493","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5x3pQf","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1910412319/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-01-25T15:15:16Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1910412319","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93764745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mosmos6","id":93764745,"login":"mosmos6","node_id":"U_kgDOBZa8iQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nHello JAX team,\r\n\r\nI am encountering an issue with JAX where only 4 TPU cores are being detected on a Google Cloud Platform TPU VM instance configured with 8 cores (type v5p-8). This issue persists even after ensuring proper installation and configuration.\r\n\r\n**Environment**:\r\n- TPU VM Type: v5p-8 (supposedly 8 cores) (preemptible)\r\n- JAX version: [0.4.23]\r\n- JAXlib version: [0.4.23]\r\n- Python version: [3.10]\r\n- Google Cloud SDK version: [460.0.0]\r\n\r\n**Steps to Reproduce**:\r\n1. Created a TPU VM on GCP with `--accelerator-type=v5p-8`.\r\n2. Installed `jax[tpu]` followed by other project dependencies.\r\n3. Ran `import jax; print(jax.devices())` in Python and consistently found only 4 TPU devices listed.\r\n\r\n**Expected Behavior**:\r\nJAX should detect and utilize all 8 TPU cores as per the TPU VM configuration.\r\n\r\n**Actual Behavior**:\r\nOnly 4 TPU cores are being detected by JAX, leading to `ValueError: each shard needs a separate device, but device count (4) < shard count (8)` when attempting to distribute work across 8 cores.\r\n\r\n**Additional Context**:\r\n- The issue occurs irrespective of using a virtual environment.\r\n- The Google Cloud Console confirms the TPU VM is configured with 8 cores.\r\n\r\nI am looking for guidance on why JAX is only detecting 4 cores and how I can resolve this to utilize all 8 cores as expected. Any help or insights you can provide would be greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nThank you for your assistance!\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\n_No response_\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional system info?\n\n_No response_\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n_No response_","closed_at":"2024-01-25T15:15:16Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93764745?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mosmos6/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://githu